Package: dkw
Title: DKW and Makarov Bounds for Individual Treatment Effect Distributions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Chase", "Mathis", email = "cmathis@berkeley.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Implements Dvoretzky-Kiefer-Wolfowitz (DKW) confidence bands for
    empirical cumulative distribution functions and Makarov bounds for individual
    treatment effect distributions. Provides tools for non-parametric inference
    on treatment effects in randomized experiments, including hybrid bounds
    combining Simes and Dempster methods for sharper confidence sets.
